WEBVTT

00:00:00.274 --> 00:00:03.174
It's pretty awesome, invincible power!

00:00:03.574 --> 00:00:06.444
Boy, does it feel great

00:00:06.814 --> 00:00:09.574
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:00:10.014 --> 00:00:13.184
Come on, let's head for tomorrow!

00:00:15.084 --> 00:00:16.224
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:17.394
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:00:17.394 --> 00:00:18.654
Zettai Karen Children
Absolutely!

00:00:18.654 --> 00:00:20.324
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:20.324 --> 00:00:21.354
Zettai Karen Children
Daring!

00:00:21.524 --> 00:00:24.834
It just takes a touch for me to know

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:27.264
The limiter on my heart

00:00:28.004 --> 00:00:30.694
Has been released, and then you see

00:00:31.104 --> 00:00:34.304
Yes! Change the world!

00:00:34.544 --> 00:00:37.404
Trying again and again through hot battle!

00:00:37.674 --> 00:00:41.014
Reaching through what's real

00:00:41.014 --> 00:00:44.254
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:00:44.254 --> 00:00:47.184
The thrills just can't be beat!

00:00:48.324 --> 00:00:54.794
Courage begins to light the
darkness of the world

00:00:54.794 --> 00:01:00.734
It overflows with the miracles you gave

00:01:01.164 --> 00:01:05.574
If you can take pride in a smile

00:01:05.574 --> 00:01:07.564
That suits no one else

00:01:07.774 --> 00:01:12.314
Then let's go beyond the future now

00:01:12.314 --> 00:01:16.404
We can try over the future world!

00:01:16.654 --> 00:01:17.014
Yeah!

00:01:17.754 --> 00:01:18.414
Ultimate!

00:01:20.554 --> 00:01:21.784
Daring!

00:01:39.874 --> 00:01:44.974
21th sense.
"Jack of All Trades, Master of None!
What's He So Mad About?!"

00:01:49.854 --> 00:01:51.944
What's wrong, Momotaro?

00:01:53.584 --> 00:01:55.854
A sigh from the sight of this lovely night scene?

00:01:56.494 --> 00:01:58.124
I was thinking I might have been happier

00:01:58.124 --> 00:02:03.694
staying with Kaoru and the others
than here, with a pervert like you.

00:02:03.694 --> 00:02:05.924
Well... Be my guest, then!

00:02:06.264 --> 00:02:11.634
But you'd be lonely without me.
You have no other friends.

00:02:11.904 --> 00:02:13.474
Mind your own business!

00:02:13.474 --> 00:02:15.244
You poor guy!

00:02:15.244 --> 00:02:17.944
Here. You can have one of my sunflower seeds.

00:02:17.944 --> 00:02:20.814
Keep it! Anyway, this is no time for games.

00:02:20.814 --> 00:02:23.554
We're going out. We'll be late
for our date, otherwise.

00:02:23.554 --> 00:02:25.254
Huh?

00:02:25.254 --> 00:02:27.154
Going out? Where?

00:02:27.854 --> 00:02:31.624
To somewhere with even prettier night scenery.

00:02:35.124 --> 00:02:39.154
Whoa! What a view! What a view!

00:02:40.034 --> 00:02:42.264
Good eve'nin'!

00:02:43.574 --> 00:02:46.334
Right on time, as always.

00:02:46.744 --> 00:02:49.874
Oh, great. He's your date?

00:02:49.874 --> 00:02:52.204
Here it is, Major Hyobu.

00:02:53.844 --> 00:02:55.084
Ah...

00:02:55.084 --> 00:02:59.314
So this report is on the espers
attached to BABEL, I see.

00:03:04.594 --> 00:03:05.964
Welcome!

00:03:05.964 --> 00:03:07.264
Welcome to BABEL.

00:03:07.264 --> 00:03:08.694
How may we help you?

00:03:08.694 --> 00:03:11.924
Well, I came to talk a little business with you.

00:03:13.604 --> 00:03:16.334
His bag has elastic bands
and tooth brushes inside.

00:03:16.334 --> 00:03:19.774
He only appeared two days ago
and seems a little shady...

00:03:19.774 --> 00:03:20.844
A high-pressure salesman!

00:03:20.844 --> 00:03:22.744
Got you in time!

00:03:23.144 --> 00:03:25.474
Turn right around and leave, please!

00:03:25.714 --> 00:03:28.184
Agh! No need for all the manpower!

00:03:28.184 --> 00:03:30.284
I didn't take any money from anyone!

00:03:30.284 --> 00:03:34.684
I'd sooner wash my face with miso soup
than ever come back here again!

00:03:36.124 --> 00:03:37.694
Don't come back, you hear?

00:03:37.694 --> 00:03:39.894
Make that miso soup the red paste kind!

00:03:39.894 --> 00:03:43.034
Natsuko Tokiwa: Level 5 clairvoyant.

00:03:43.034 --> 00:03:45.934
And Hotaru Nowaki: Level 5 telepath.

00:03:45.934 --> 00:03:49.204
BABEL's receptionists who never let
any suspicious persons slip past.

00:03:49.204 --> 00:03:50.874
Also known as Doubleface.

00:03:50.874 --> 00:03:51.534
Yay!

00:03:52.374 --> 00:03:53.674
I see.

00:03:53.674 --> 00:03:56.144
Even with BABEL's heavy security,

00:03:56.144 --> 00:03:58.414
you can still easily get in, can't you, Major?

00:03:58.414 --> 00:04:00.244
True, I can,

00:04:00.244 --> 00:04:03.774
but it helps to have a trusted confidante
investigate this for me.

00:04:03.954 --> 00:04:07.474
A... trusted confidante?

00:04:07.924 --> 00:04:10.324
Of course. That's you.

00:04:12.394 --> 00:04:15.824
No one's ever spoken about
me that way before!

00:04:16.164 --> 00:04:18.794
I'm Moga-chan! I'm ready to do anything for you!

00:04:21.504 --> 00:04:23.204
Well, you're enthusiastic, at least.

00:04:23.204 --> 00:04:24.674
Wrong phrase!

00:04:24.674 --> 00:04:27.804
Hearing Major Hyobu say
that makes me so happy!

00:04:28.244 --> 00:04:29.904
Say it yourself, then.

00:04:31.014 --> 00:04:35.184
I hope you keep on giving me
vital information about BABEL.

00:04:35.184 --> 00:04:36.584
I will!

00:04:36.584 --> 00:04:39.214
Now then, let's keep reading.

00:04:41.424 --> 00:04:44.394
Naomi Umegae, Level 6 psychokinetic.

00:04:44.394 --> 00:04:46.494
I told you not to touch me, didn't I?!

00:04:46.494 --> 00:04:48.764
You birdbrain!

00:04:48.764 --> 00:04:53.964
Has daily lovers' spats with her
supervisor, Ichiro Tanizaki, age 36.

00:04:54.804 --> 00:04:57.104
BABEL truly is a fun place, isn't it?

00:04:57.104 --> 00:04:59.834
You're free to have workplace romances, huh?

00:05:00.674 --> 00:05:03.164
Special espers: The Hound.

00:05:04.114 --> 00:05:08.484
Hatsune Inugami, with metamorphosis powers.

00:05:08.484 --> 00:05:10.884
And Akira Yadorigi, with the power of Replace.

00:05:10.884 --> 00:05:14.224
Has the ability to possess and
control the minds of animals.

00:05:14.224 --> 00:05:16.184
Those are powers worth my attention.

00:05:17.494 --> 00:05:21.514
Shuji Sakaki, ESP Doctor and ladies man.

00:05:23.164 --> 00:05:26.034
These are regular staffers and
not espers, aren't they?

00:05:26.034 --> 00:05:26.934
Normals?

00:05:26.934 --> 00:05:30.304
Right! The operator girls in the control center!

00:05:30.304 --> 00:05:33.744
Irregular psychic waves detected
in farming area to the northeast!

00:05:33.974 --> 00:05:37.314
BABEL 1 is patrolling nearby.
Reroute it to the scene at once!

00:05:37.314 --> 00:05:39.714
BABEL 1, arriving in local airspace...

00:05:39.714 --> 00:05:41.084
Wha?! A cow?!

00:05:41.084 --> 00:05:42.484
We have sat vid incoming.

00:05:42.484 --> 00:05:46.354
Abnormal psychic waves
identified as the panic cry of

00:05:46.354 --> 00:05:50.944
an esper cowboy whose red clothes
got a herd of cows chasing him.

00:05:52.524 --> 00:05:56.464
Ignore the man. Secure from alert status!

00:05:56.464 --> 00:05:58.234
Ran-chan especially!

00:05:58.234 --> 00:06:02.104
I mean Ranko Kaneko is especially fantastic!

00:06:02.104 --> 00:06:06.234
What's your opinion of the Normals
who work in BABEL, Mr. Kugutsu?

00:06:06.474 --> 00:06:08.644
Well, let's see.

00:06:08.644 --> 00:06:12.914
They seem to be people who understand espers.

00:06:12.914 --> 00:06:14.174
You really think so?

00:06:14.484 --> 00:06:16.884
They're government workers
with nice, safe government jobs.

00:06:16.884 --> 00:06:19.314
Living nice, stable lives with
no chance of getting fired.

00:06:19.554 --> 00:06:21.754
Be that as it may!

00:06:21.754 --> 00:06:25.384
You took a lot of pictures without them
noticing, didn't you, Mr. Kugutsu?

00:06:25.794 --> 00:06:28.064
I'm glad you noticed, sir!

00:06:28.064 --> 00:06:30.564
I have other abilities aside from
being a puppet master.

00:06:30.564 --> 00:06:33.124
Ones that no one else can match!

00:06:33.834 --> 00:06:34.634
Like..?

00:06:34.904 --> 00:06:38.964
No one can be as inconspicuous as me!

00:06:39.874 --> 00:06:40.704
Umida?

00:06:40.704 --> 00:06:41.474
Here.

00:06:41.474 --> 00:06:42.144
Oda?

00:06:42.144 --> 00:06:42.844
Here.

00:06:42.844 --> 00:06:43.444
Kato?

00:06:43.444 --> 00:06:44.274
Here.

00:06:44.274 --> 00:06:44.914
Kimura?

00:06:44.914 --> 00:06:45.644
Here.

00:06:45.644 --> 00:06:46.314
Kenzaki?

00:06:46.314 --> 00:06:46.914
Here.

00:06:46.914 --> 00:06:47.514
Kojima?

00:06:47.514 --> 00:06:48.204
Here.

00:06:48.614 --> 00:06:51.214
I was so inconspicuous that
I'd never even be noticed

00:06:51.214 --> 00:06:52.814
when they were taking attendance!

00:06:55.154 --> 00:06:58.554
So, since I had that ability

00:06:58.554 --> 00:07:02.824
no one ever even noticed me standing
right next to them with a camera!

00:07:04.164 --> 00:07:06.994
Even though I wanted them to notice!

00:07:08.364 --> 00:07:11.894
They wouldn't notice me unless I hauled
off and punched one of them!

00:07:13.274 --> 00:07:16.344
Here, you can have a couple
of my sunflower seeds.

00:07:16.344 --> 00:07:19.404
So please don't cry. Okay? Okay?

00:07:20.814 --> 00:07:26.654
Oh? Kiritsubo's only 54 and has a
granddaughter in high school?

00:07:26.654 --> 00:07:28.884
Pretty young to be a grandfather, huh?

00:07:28.884 --> 00:07:30.684
Another guy who takes his work seriously, huh?

00:07:32.324 --> 00:07:34.294
Catching a cold, Chief?

00:07:34.294 --> 00:07:36.284
Or somebody's gossiping about me.

00:07:37.664 --> 00:07:41.434
Maybe those adorable Children are doing it!

00:07:41.434 --> 00:07:43.864
I'm pretty sure they're not, sir!

00:07:45.234 --> 00:07:48.574
Captain Oboro Kashiwagi.
Kiritsubo's personal assistant.

00:07:48.574 --> 00:07:51.064
Truly a woman who embodies
both brains and beauty.

00:07:53.184 --> 00:07:57.684
Pardon me! I'm still investigating
Captain Kashiwagi.

00:07:57.684 --> 00:07:59.314
Great. Big help, you are!

00:07:59.314 --> 00:08:04.224
Thank you. I hope you will continue
to assist me from within BABEL.

00:08:04.724 --> 00:08:05.994
Leave it to me!

00:08:05.994 --> 00:08:06.994
Go to it!

00:08:06.994 --> 00:08:08.824
I really can depend on you.

00:08:08.824 --> 00:08:11.794
Yes, sir! Moga-chan and I
will keep doing our best!

00:08:11.794 --> 00:08:13.564
I'll spread my legs wide and distract them!

00:08:13.564 --> 00:08:14.864
Wrong phrase!

00:08:14.864 --> 00:08:16.424
I'll work my fingers to the bone!

00:08:18.274 --> 00:08:21.404
We'll do this, bit by bit.

00:08:24.944 --> 00:08:27.414
BABEL is a money pit!

00:08:27.414 --> 00:08:28.684
Hear, hear!

00:08:28.684 --> 00:08:30.414
How many hundreds of millions will satisfy you?!

00:08:30.614 --> 00:08:32.214
But we need it!

00:08:32.214 --> 00:08:34.224
You're spending too much!

00:08:34.224 --> 00:08:36.154
That still doesn't mean we don't need it.

00:08:36.924 --> 00:08:38.784
More tea, sir?

00:08:39.224 --> 00:08:40.364
Tea?

00:08:40.364 --> 00:08:42.164
Please.

00:08:42.164 --> 00:08:43.454
Thank you.

00:08:49.004 --> 00:08:51.434
Well, I suppose it can't be helped.

00:08:51.434 --> 00:08:54.604
BABEL does an important job as well, doesn't it?

00:08:54.604 --> 00:08:57.804
Y-Yeah! We can spare a few
hundred million more for you.

00:08:58.414 --> 00:09:01.934
Yeah! Hear, hear!

00:09:05.954 --> 00:09:07.584
Kashiwagi, what did you put in that tea?

00:09:08.824 --> 00:09:11.054
Just sincerity, sir.

00:09:20.234 --> 00:09:23.874
Oboro Kashiwagi. A talented
woman that everyone yearns for.

00:09:23.874 --> 00:09:26.874
But her private life is a complete mystery.

00:09:26.874 --> 00:09:28.704
And I shall lift that veil!

00:09:29.474 --> 00:09:32.274
Gone! Is it possible that... she's an esper?!

00:09:33.144 --> 00:09:34.634
Ow!

00:09:34.914 --> 00:09:38.354
How strange! She's clumsy!
And just slipped on a banana peel!

00:09:38.354 --> 00:09:40.614
A mystery! Mysteries upon mysteries!

00:09:41.924 --> 00:09:44.184
Time to get this scoop!

00:09:45.324 --> 00:09:47.484
Oh... Oh, crap!

00:09:47.964 --> 00:09:50.934
You! I! This is! Um!

00:09:52.934 --> 00:09:54.764
Morning, Ms. Kashiwagi.

00:09:54.764 --> 00:09:55.704
Morning.

00:09:55.704 --> 00:09:57.604
Pretty as always, I see.

00:09:57.604 --> 00:09:58.774
Thank you.

00:09:58.774 --> 00:10:00.604
Your skin is so smooth, Kashiwagi!

00:10:00.604 --> 00:10:02.004
You're just saying that.

00:10:02.544 --> 00:10:04.844
Ms. Kashiwagi, what about tonight?

00:10:04.844 --> 00:10:07.174
I'll tell your wife on you.

00:10:07.814 --> 00:10:09.484
Maybe it's my imagination,

00:10:09.484 --> 00:10:12.884
but it's felt like someone's been
watching me for the past few days.

00:10:12.884 --> 00:10:14.714
Like I'm being followed...

00:10:14.954 --> 00:10:15.924
WOMEN'S CHANGING ROOM
(Absolutely do no open!)

00:10:17.224 --> 00:10:19.994
I definitely feel someone watching me!

00:10:19.994 --> 00:10:21.854
There!

00:10:23.464 --> 00:10:25.264
Did I imagine it?

00:10:25.264 --> 00:10:28.994
Here's a treasure of a shot!
Oboro, changing clothes in the nude!

00:10:29.604 --> 00:10:31.164
Kaoru!

00:10:32.274 --> 00:10:33.274
Cut it out.

00:10:33.274 --> 00:10:34.744
You laugh like a creepy old guy.

00:10:34.804 --> 00:10:37.574
Hip! Waist! Bust!

00:10:37.574 --> 00:10:40.174
Psychic Measurements, achieved!

00:10:40.514 --> 00:10:42.784
Your psychokinesis has nothing to do with that!

00:10:42.784 --> 00:10:45.054
Kaoru has a wild animal inside of her.

00:10:45.054 --> 00:10:49.354
Stop it! It's bad manners to gawk at
someone when they're changing!

00:10:49.354 --> 00:10:51.724
Okay! Sorry!

00:10:51.724 --> 00:10:55.194
You're the one who's been
stalking me, haven't you?!

00:10:55.194 --> 00:10:58.064
Huh? No! No! Not at all!

00:10:58.064 --> 00:11:00.124
This is just a extremely severe
first offense for me!

00:11:00.434 --> 00:11:03.234
Yeah, I'm here now ogling like I'm licking you,

00:11:03.234 --> 00:11:06.134
but I wouldn't go sneaking
around spying like a coward!

00:11:06.134 --> 00:11:07.004
Don't be so proud.

00:11:07.004 --> 00:11:08.774
And shut that digicam off.

00:11:08.774 --> 00:11:13.304
So, if it isn't Kaoru, then who?

00:11:17.614 --> 00:11:19.644
I want to be popular!

00:11:22.554 --> 00:11:24.684
Now, now, you shouldn't do that.

00:11:25.524 --> 00:11:27.854
You wanted my advice about
something, Ms. Kashiwagi?

00:11:28.394 --> 00:11:31.964
I feel like someone's been stalking
me for the last few days...

00:11:31.964 --> 00:11:34.194
Oh, Kaoru?

00:11:34.864 --> 00:11:36.634
She's incorrigible.

00:11:36.634 --> 00:11:38.764
It doesn't seem to be Kaoru.

00:11:41.844 --> 00:11:44.974
Please, Minamoto...

00:11:45.344 --> 00:11:47.814
M-Ms. Kashiwagi!

00:11:52.254 --> 00:11:53.984
Good morning!

00:11:53.984 --> 00:11:55.574
Good morning.

00:11:57.654 --> 00:12:00.094
M-Minamoto, good morning...

00:12:05.364 --> 00:12:07.234
What was that?

00:12:08.534 --> 00:12:12.524
She's taking a long time. Is it
possible Ms. Kashiwagi is?!

00:12:12.904 --> 00:12:14.844
Ms. Kashiwagi?!

00:12:15.844 --> 00:12:19.364
I absolutely won't forgive a rude person!

00:12:20.244 --> 00:12:21.804
MINAMOTO!

00:12:25.754 --> 00:12:28.524
You've been following Kashiwagi, haven't you?!

00:12:28.524 --> 00:12:30.454
No, Chief! There's a reason...

00:12:30.454 --> 00:12:33.364
What could you possibly have been thinking?!

00:12:33.364 --> 00:12:34.824
Look, she asked...

00:12:34.824 --> 00:12:37.794
Excuses just cheapen you in my eyes!

00:12:37.794 --> 00:12:39.364
Please, hear me out!

00:12:39.364 --> 00:12:41.234
Chief, it's not what it looks like.

00:12:41.234 --> 00:12:42.164
It isn't?

00:12:42.164 --> 00:12:43.634
Listening now?

00:12:44.104 --> 00:12:46.364
Right. The truth is...

00:12:48.204 --> 00:12:52.344
Oh! Minamoto, why didn't you say so?

00:12:52.344 --> 00:12:54.614
Because you weren't listening to me at all?

00:12:54.614 --> 00:12:58.454
But why would anyone be
stalking Ms. Kashiwagi?

00:12:58.454 --> 00:13:00.924
Simple. Love.

00:13:00.924 --> 00:13:01.984
Love?!

00:13:01.984 --> 00:13:08.094
Indeed! It's only natural to want to know
more about someone you've fallen for!

00:13:08.094 --> 00:13:09.834
So, you stalk them?

00:13:09.834 --> 00:13:14.034
I know what I speak of, since
Naomi stalks me all the time!

00:13:14.034 --> 00:13:14.904
Ow!

00:13:14.904 --> 00:13:18.334
WHO'S stalking you?! Isn't something
a little wrong there?!

00:13:18.334 --> 00:13:19.904
No need to be shy.

00:13:19.904 --> 00:13:21.204
I'm not shy!

00:13:21.204 --> 00:13:25.314
Lots of people are in love with you,
so who could it be?

00:13:25.314 --> 00:13:28.414
Could it be him? Or maybe it's...

00:13:28.414 --> 00:13:29.884
Oh? Who is it?

00:13:29.884 --> 00:13:31.114
Tell us! Tell us!

00:13:31.114 --> 00:13:31.914
Me, too!

00:13:31.914 --> 00:13:33.014
Me, three!

00:13:33.014 --> 00:13:34.854
From what I've heard...

00:13:34.854 --> 00:13:35.684
Stop it.

00:13:37.354 --> 00:13:40.224
It's not right to pry into someone's love.

00:13:41.324 --> 00:13:42.594
Let it be.

00:13:42.864 --> 00:13:45.534
Oh! Spoken like an honors student!

00:13:45.534 --> 00:13:48.904
Brilliant! Brilliant! She's finally matured!

00:13:48.904 --> 00:13:50.924
Ooh! 100 yen! Aw, no it's not.

00:13:52.104 --> 00:13:53.144
Strange...

00:13:53.144 --> 00:13:55.004
When it comes to love gossip about someone

00:13:55.004 --> 00:13:57.494
Kaoru should be sticking her nose in first!

00:13:58.114 --> 00:14:01.814
Besides, even knowing I was
following Ms. Kashiwagi...

00:14:01.814 --> 00:14:03.914
She said nothing! Kaoru, of all people!

00:14:03.914 --> 00:14:06.354
Normally, I'd expect her to
be the angriest one at you!

00:14:06.684 --> 00:14:07.654
It's suspicious!

00:14:09.254 --> 00:14:13.594
Why? Why do I have to make
something like this?!

00:14:14.894 --> 00:14:17.764
Just when I'd been spotted...

00:14:19.194 --> 00:14:21.764
You're so inconspicuous that
you're gonna get stepped on

00:14:21.764 --> 00:14:23.434
or kicked sitting there, Mr. Kugutsu.

00:14:23.434 --> 00:14:26.424
I wasn't doing anything!

00:14:31.844 --> 00:14:34.114
Oh, Mr. Kugutsu!

00:14:34.114 --> 00:14:35.084
What? It's...

00:14:35.084 --> 00:14:36.414
You like Oboro!

00:14:36.414 --> 00:14:38.254
No way! No way!

00:14:38.254 --> 00:14:40.784
If they found out I was spying,
I'd be thrown out of BABEL.

00:14:40.784 --> 00:14:43.694
I wouldn't be able to pass information
to Major Hyobu anymore!

00:14:43.694 --> 00:14:46.494
I'll keep quiet about it.
Please, don't tell them!

00:14:46.494 --> 00:14:47.224
Really?!

00:14:47.524 --> 00:14:52.554
But I never knew you had a thing for Oboro!

00:14:53.864 --> 00:14:56.764
Maybe I should play along with her for now.

00:14:57.404 --> 00:14:58.974
You'll really keep quiet about this?

00:14:58.974 --> 00:15:03.344
Of course, but only if you do me a favor.

00:15:05.644 --> 00:15:07.544
In exchange for keeping quiet,

00:15:07.544 --> 00:15:10.514
I have to build her a 1:1
scale mechanical Oboro.

00:15:10.514 --> 00:15:12.854
Elementary school kids these days!

00:15:12.854 --> 00:15:16.324
The body is based off of the
measurements Kaoru got,

00:15:16.324 --> 00:15:18.894
while movement and behavior
patterns come from

00:15:18.894 --> 00:15:21.754
data I've input based on several
days of following her.

00:15:22.164 --> 00:15:25.534
But I have no interest in Ms. Kashiwagi.

00:15:25.534 --> 00:15:29.334
If I was going to make anyone...
It'd be Ran-chan.

00:15:35.874 --> 00:15:39.714
It looks just like her! Exactly like her!

00:15:40.114 --> 00:15:42.214
The very limits of!

00:15:42.214 --> 00:15:43.644
Done yet?

00:15:47.954 --> 00:15:49.924
Nearly done! Nearly done!

00:15:51.224 --> 00:15:53.794
Once it's done, I can sleep
with my head in her lap!

00:15:53.794 --> 00:15:55.594
Have her clean my ears!

00:15:55.594 --> 00:15:57.364
Take baths with her!

00:15:57.364 --> 00:15:58.694
Take her to bed with me!

00:16:00.504 --> 00:16:05.234
Incident alert! Incident alert!
Special espers, move out!

00:16:05.434 --> 00:16:07.944
A man's taken a hostage and
barricaded himself inside.

00:16:07.944 --> 00:16:10.174
We need to be careful, because there's
a high probability that he's an esper.

00:16:10.614 --> 00:16:13.144
One step closer and Pooko gets it!

00:16:13.144 --> 00:16:13.734
Oink.

00:16:14.314 --> 00:16:15.614
The hostage is...

00:16:15.614 --> 00:16:16.384
That?

00:16:16.384 --> 00:16:18.954
Biologically speaking, that looks like...

00:16:18.954 --> 00:16:19.884
A pig.

00:16:19.884 --> 00:16:24.654
I love Pooko! I demand that society
acknowledge our relationship!

00:16:24.654 --> 00:16:25.394
Oink.

00:16:25.394 --> 00:16:27.824
Pooko! We'll save you!

00:16:27.824 --> 00:16:30.534
If she gets scared, it'll make the meat tough!

00:16:30.534 --> 00:16:31.934
What's going on?

00:16:31.934 --> 00:16:35.234
Apparently the perp fell in love at first sight
with that pig when it was out for a walk.

00:16:35.234 --> 00:16:38.904
He started stalking it, and when the
owner chewed him out about it...

00:16:38.904 --> 00:16:41.104
It ended up like this?

00:16:41.104 --> 00:16:46.104
A waste of time! The Children, released!

00:16:46.314 --> 00:16:46.874
<<RELEASED>>

00:16:47.214 --> 00:16:49.384
Love is blind, so boys should love!

00:16:49.384 --> 00:16:51.584
Love is also strange!

00:16:51.584 --> 00:16:53.984
Even so boys, when it hits you, it may break you!

00:16:53.984 --> 00:16:56.254
Stalking someone is an act of evil!

00:16:56.254 --> 00:17:01.164
If you're gonna stalk, be like
Mr. Kugutsu and don't get caught!

00:17:01.164 --> 00:17:02.094
Kaoru?

00:17:02.094 --> 00:17:03.964
What was that about Mr. Kugutsu?

00:17:03.964 --> 00:17:06.094
Um, that has nothing to do with this.

00:17:06.094 --> 00:17:10.054
Special espers: The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:17:13.034 --> 00:17:16.034
Three straight all-nighters...
I need to change my underwear.

00:17:22.184 --> 00:17:23.984
Ran-chan!

00:17:23.984 --> 00:17:26.784
E-Excuse me, Mr. Kugutsu!

00:17:27.284 --> 00:17:32.224
N-No, excuse me! Are you okay?
Wait, you know my name?

00:17:32.724 --> 00:17:35.224
Of course I know it.

00:17:35.224 --> 00:17:40.094
You're just about the only one
who ever calls me Ran-chan, so...

00:17:40.634 --> 00:17:42.534
Of course I know...
Oh, sorry about your coffee!

00:17:48.404 --> 00:17:49.734
Case closed.

00:17:49.974 --> 00:17:52.744
But you didn't have to go that
far to catch him, did you?

00:17:52.744 --> 00:17:55.244
But he used his powers to flip my skirt.

00:17:55.244 --> 00:17:56.954
Shouldn't have been so unwilling.

00:17:56.954 --> 00:17:58.914
Now, then...

00:17:58.914 --> 00:18:01.784
Let's start with the story about Kugutsu.

00:18:02.254 --> 00:18:05.224
Um, you want a story? A fairy tale?

00:18:05.224 --> 00:18:08.024
How about the urban legend of
Second Avenue in Shinjuku?

00:18:08.464 --> 00:18:10.194
Shiho?

00:18:10.194 --> 00:18:11.724
Leave it to me.

00:18:13.234 --> 00:18:14.834
P-Please, come in.

00:18:14.834 --> 00:18:16.204
If it's no bother.

00:18:16.204 --> 00:18:18.434
It's kind of a mess.

00:18:18.434 --> 00:18:20.804
Oh, no. It's fine.

00:18:21.374 --> 00:18:25.974
Oh, it's amazing? Did you
make these, Mr. Kugutsu?

00:18:25.974 --> 00:18:29.344
Yes! We were made by the master!

00:18:29.344 --> 00:18:32.114
We are always grateful to our master!

00:18:32.114 --> 00:18:34.184
Oh! It's a pleasure!

00:18:34.184 --> 00:18:36.854
Amazing! Just amazing!

00:18:36.854 --> 00:18:40.794
Um, here... Would you look at this?

00:18:41.864 --> 00:18:44.134
Is this me?

00:18:44.134 --> 00:18:47.964
The truth is... For years now, I've...

00:18:48.834 --> 00:18:50.434
Kugutsu, are you in here?!

00:18:50.434 --> 00:18:52.604
Ch-Chief!

00:18:52.604 --> 00:18:55.664
Kaoru told us everything!

00:18:56.204 --> 00:18:59.714
How desperately in love with Kashiwagi you are!

00:18:59.714 --> 00:19:02.874
And how wrong you went when
you couldn't tell her that!

00:19:03.244 --> 00:19:08.584
And how you built a 1:1 scale mechanical
Oboro to comfort yourself!

00:19:09.024 --> 00:19:10.654
WHAT?!!!

00:19:10.654 --> 00:19:13.594
That was for Kaoru!

00:19:14.524 --> 00:19:15.864
Mr. Kugutsu...

00:19:15.864 --> 00:19:17.934
Ran-chan, this is!

00:19:17.934 --> 00:19:22.664
Stalking her wasn't enough,
so to make your mecha Oboro,

00:19:22.764 --> 00:19:25.874
you sent Kaoru to get
Ms. Kashiwagi's measurements!

00:19:25.874 --> 00:19:27.704
No! You're wrong!

00:19:27.704 --> 00:19:29.194
Ew! You're gross!

00:19:29.974 --> 00:19:33.774
You were going to sleep in its lap
and have it clean your ears!

00:19:35.944 --> 00:19:39.974
It's not true! I wouldn't do that! I'd never!

00:19:40.224 --> 00:19:42.124
Ah! An exact copy!

00:19:42.124 --> 00:19:43.324
Immovable proof!

00:19:43.324 --> 00:19:44.994
Or movable, in this case.

00:19:44.994 --> 00:19:47.184
Mr. Kugutsu...

00:20:06.314 --> 00:20:07.584
Sorry.

00:20:07.584 --> 00:20:09.984
Huh? For what?

00:20:10.384 --> 00:20:16.544
I appreciate how you feel,
but you're just not my type!

00:20:17.194 --> 00:20:19.194
I'm really sorry.

00:20:19.194 --> 00:20:21.924
Really sorry, really sorry, really sorry...

00:20:22.464 --> 00:20:27.164
Now, no more stalking me, okay?

00:20:27.404 --> 00:20:29.304
Get your love life straightened out!

00:20:29.304 --> 00:20:33.544
Person and person, person and pig,
person and doll...

00:20:33.544 --> 00:20:35.344
Think of the forms love takes.

00:20:35.344 --> 00:20:38.674
God... And keep these girls out of it!

00:20:39.014 --> 00:20:44.414
Um, I know I kinda screwed you
over here, but... Sorry!

00:20:46.854 --> 00:20:50.224
Aw, don't let it get you down!
There's plenty of girls around!

00:20:50.224 --> 00:20:53.244
I'll take you to the next group date I go on.

00:20:56.464 --> 00:20:57.434
Miss?

00:20:57.434 --> 00:21:00.594
Yes, Dr. Sakaki?

00:21:06.374 --> 00:21:11.344
You're beautiful. Are you free tonight?

00:21:11.344 --> 00:21:15.144
Why don't we have dinner and
get to know each other better?

00:21:15.484 --> 00:21:17.654
S-Sure.

00:21:17.654 --> 00:21:20.554
Mr. Kugutsu loves Ms. Kashiwagi.

00:21:20.554 --> 00:21:24.784
Besides, Dr. Sakaki is so dreamy...

00:21:25.494 --> 00:21:27.854
Japanese food? A tempura set meal?

00:21:28.464 --> 00:21:33.694
Okay! I know a great place!
The tempura sauce is so sweet!

00:21:48.214 --> 00:21:51.184
To hell with BABEL! To hell with those kids!

00:21:51.184 --> 00:21:53.654
To hell with that lady killer Sakaki!

00:21:53.654 --> 00:21:55.884
I absolutely will never forgive them!

00:21:58.394 --> 00:22:02.094
This disgrace I've suffered...
This resentment I now bear!

00:22:02.094 --> 00:22:05.694
IT MUST BE ASSUAGED!

00:22:10.734 --> 00:22:16.174
Because, you're my heart's desire!

00:22:16.174 --> 00:22:16.474
Yeah

00:22:33.524 --> 00:22:36.794
When it comes to you, you see

00:22:38.564 --> 00:22:44.024
My ESP is no good at all

00:22:44.374 --> 00:22:50.534
Love is a puzzle that even

00:22:50.914 --> 00:22:53.144
Pythagoras couldn't solve

00:22:55.414 --> 00:23:00.074
Don't hang your head or have a tearful face

00:23:00.524 --> 00:23:05.424
Because miracles are born from smiles

00:23:06.054 --> 00:23:07.524
My, my, my heart's desire

00:23:07.524 --> 00:23:07.824
Zoom zoom!

00:23:07.824 --> 00:23:08.824
I want to make

00:23:08.824 --> 00:23:09.224
Bye-bye!

00:23:09.224 --> 00:23:12.954
You my bold desire

00:23:13.094 --> 00:23:17.134
So absolutely serious, it gives me chills!

00:23:17.134 --> 00:23:18.574
Trans, trans, transform

00:23:18.574 --> 00:23:18.834
Zoom zoom!

00:23:18.834 --> 00:23:19.834
I'll give you

00:23:19.834 --> 00:23:20.444
Yeah yeah!

00:23:20.444 --> 00:23:25.274
A dynamite kiss!

00:23:25.414 --> 00:23:28.184
I absolutely want you to love me!

00:23:28.184 --> 00:23:38.414
Because, you're my heart's desire

00:23:39.954 --> 00:23:41.094
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:41.094 --> 00:23:42.964
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.964 --> 00:23:43.364
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.364 --> 00:23:45.334
Ugh, I'm so sick...

00:23:45.334 --> 00:23:47.934
That's what I get doing this for a week straight.

00:23:47.934 --> 00:23:49.094
Mr. Minamoto!

00:23:49.334 --> 00:23:50.704
You smell like booze and perfume!

00:23:50.704 --> 00:23:51.604
What's this card from an adult club?!

00:23:51.604 --> 00:23:52.934
You've got lipstick on you!

00:23:52.934 --> 00:23:56.774
It's for work! I don't like going
out drinking every night!

00:23:56.774 --> 00:23:58.514
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:58.514 --> 00:24:02.014
