Minamoto's Been Gunned Down?!"

00:24:02.014 --> 00:24:04.984
You seem troubled. Anything a puppet
master like me might do to help?

00:24:04.984 --> 00:24:06.214
Create a Learning Environment!
Minamoto's Being Gunned Down!?
You seem troubled. Anything a puppet
master like me might do to help?

00:24:06.214 --> 00:24:08.524
Create a Learning Environment!
Minamoto's Being Gunned Down!?
We're absolutely lovely, so we never fail!

